# CatDex Design System

**Source of truth:** Figma Cat-DEX-UI (`qIYWbKuvILi9hjSmT60rmn` node `218:40`) implemented in `src/theme/` via `useTheme()`. Never hardcode hex/rgba or ad-hoc spacing. Do not use tokens from `ChatDex Mobile App UI/` (web export).

```ts
import { useTheme } from '@/theme';
const { colors, spacing, radius, typography, shadow, gradients, motion, iconSize } = useTheme();
```

## Colors (white-first · indigo primary `#6C63FF`)

| Token | Value | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `brand` / `accent` / `primary` / `textBrand` | `#6C63FF` | Primary actions, FAB, headings, active nav |
| `brandHover` / `primaryHover` | `#756CFF` | Hover |
| `brandPressed` / `primaryPressed` / `accentPressed` | `#5C53F5` | Pressed |
| `brandSoft` / `primarySoft` / `accentSoft` | `rgba(108,99,255,0.12)` | Soft indigo tint |
| `background` | `#FFFFFF` | App canvas |
| `surface` / `surfaceSecondary` | `#F8F9FC` | Muted panels, secondary fills |
| `surfaceElevated` | `#FFFFFF` | Cards, sheets |
| `border` / `borderDefault` | `#E5E7EB` | Borders |
| `text` | `#111827` | Primary ink |
| `textBody` | `rgba(17,24,39,0.78)` | Body copy |
| `textSecondary` | `#6B7280` | Supporting text |
| `textMuted` / `placeholder` | `#9CA3AF` | Metadata, placeholders |
| `focusRing` | `#6C63FF` | Focus |
| `success` | `#22C55E` | Success |
| `warning` | `#F59E0B` | Warning |
| `danger` | `#EF4444` | Danger / destructive |
| `onAccent` / `onPrimary` / `onBrand` | `#FFFFFF` | On indigo / danger |
| `tabBar` | `#FFFFFF` | Bottom nav |

Rarity (game only, `src/lib/catTheme.ts`): common `#6B7280` · rare `#3B82F6` · epic `#8B5CF6` · legendary `#F59E0B`.

**Gradients:** `primary` indigo, `xp` indigo→green. Avoid heavy multi-stop gradients.

## Typography

Font: **Inter** (all platforms). Use `<Text variant="…" color="…" />`.

| Variant | Size / Line / Tracking |
|---|---|
| `display` | 34 / 40 / -0.68 (−2%) |
| `h1` (Heading) | 28 / 34 / -0.56 (−2%) |
| `h2` / `h3` (Title) | 20 / 26 / 0 |
| `body` | 16 / 24 / 0 |
| `bodySmall` / `caption` | 13 / 18 / 0 |
| `button` | 15 / 22 / 0 |
| `label` | 12 / 16 / +0.24 (+2%) |

## Spacing — Figma 8pt system

Allowed: `4 · 8 · 12 · 16 · 20 · 24 · 32 · 40 · 48 · 56 · 64` (+ `80`/`96` for large layout gaps).  
Screen padding `24` · card padding `16` · section gap `32` · button heights `36`/`48`/`56`.

## Radius

| Token | Value | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `sm` / `xs` | 12 | Compact controls |
| `md` / `cta` | 16 | Buttons, inputs |
| `lg` | 20 | Cards, panels |
| `xl` / `sheet` | 28 | Sheets, large media |
| `pill` / `full` | 999 | Chips, FAB, avatar, badge |

## Elevation

Apple-style soft shadows (neutral ink `#111827`):

| Token | Use |
|---|---|
| `soft` / `low` | Buttons, chips |
| `card` / `medium` | Cards, tiles |
| `lifted` / `large` | Popovers, markers |
| `sheet` / `floating` | Bottom sheets, nav |
| `glow` | Primary FAB halo |

## Motion / Icons

`fast≈140 · standard/normal≈220 · slow≈320 · reveal≈520`. Press `0.98` / card `0.99`.  
Icons: inline `react-native-svg`; sizes `sm=16 md=24 lg=32 xl=40`.

## Components

- Prefer shared: `Text`, `Button` (`primary|secondary|outline|ghost|text|destructive|icon`), `TextInput`/`SearchInput`, `Card`/`PhotoCard`, `Chip`, `Badge`, `BottomSheet`, `EmptyState`, `Spinner`/`Skeleton`.
- Brand: **CatDex** — “Ton quartier. Tes chats.”

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<View style={{ backgroundColor: '#1a1a2e', padding: 13, shadowOpacity: 0.5 }} />

// ✅ GOOD
const { colors, spacing, radius, shadow } = useTheme();
<View style={[{ backgroundColor: colors.surfaceElevated, padding: spacing.md, borderRadius: radius.lg, borderWidth: 1, borderColor: colors.border }, shadow.card]} />
<Text variant="h1" color="text">Title</Text>
```
